Package: com.mbucc9000.sipphone
Name: SIP Phone
Version: 1.0.14
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Make and receive VoIP.ms (SIP) calls through the stock Phone app. Dial as usual and the call goes over SIP; emergency numbers stay on cellular. Incoming calls ring with your ringtone, wake the screen and show a stock-style call screen. Needs a VoIP.ms account. Settings > SIP Phone.
Author: mbucc9000
Maintainer: mbucc9000
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 6.0)
